<decisions #add-workflow-cli-heredoc-session-continuation apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" [
  <decision #track.workflow_cli_heredoc.explicit_source { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = false } (
    <question ?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFK>
    Workflow CLI 如何接收 heredoc 多行指令？
    </?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFK>
    <answer (
      <raw-answer ?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFM>
      使用标准 `command - <<'EOF'` stdin 风格动态传入多行文本。
      </?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFM>
      <decision-text ?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFN>
      位置参数 `/dev/stdin` 或 `-` 显式选择 stdin；单行文本继续原样使用。
      </?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFN>
      <rationale ?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFP>
      显式输入源与文件型 CLI 一致，不会在普通错误调用时隐式挂起。
      </?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFP>
      <evidence ?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFQ>
      Eidolon exec 已使用 `-` 和共享 readHeadlessInput，可直接支持标准 shell heredoc。
      </?01M05F1PS4CJ59PTH3WPNFSDFQ>
    )>
  )>
]>
